{
  "version": 1,
  "generation": 2,
  "notes": "Synthetic Gen2 mechanic vectors for Lua/JS BattleSim2 parity. No ROM data: every number is synthetic; ITEMS names only the item and species ids the carts' id-keyed rules compare against (pret labels, not ROM bytes) and the HELD_* effect names, never a value read from an item row. All arithmetic is integer. DAMAGE (pokecrystal BattleCommand_DamageCalc): no 255-stat clamp inside compute(), which takes the byte pair TruncateHL_BC hands it (see TRUNCATE). levelTerm = floor(2L/5)+2 (crit does NOT double L). base = floor(floor(levelTerm*power*attack/defense)/50). Then optional item boost, crit x2, then min(d,997)+2. STAB floor(d*15/10). Type effectiveness is a list of percents applied one at a time as floor(d*pct/100) with a non-immune floor of 1. Variation last: when modified>=2, damage=max(1,min(999,floor(d*roll/100))) for roll in 85..100. Physical reads attack/atk; special (physical:false) reads spa (legacy spc) vs spd (legacy spc). CRIT: ladder 1-in-{15,8,4,3,2,2,2} by critical level 0..6; isCrit when roll==0 for roll in 0..chance-1. Level += focusEnergy(+1), highCritMove(+2), scopeLens(+1), capped at 6; speciesItemBonus (Lucky Punch / Stick) SETS the level to 2, past the others (BattleCommand_Critical's jump to .Tally). ACCURACY: percent domain; accuracy 0 or alwaysHits never misses; else value=stage-scaled accuracy clamped 1..100, hit = roll < value for roll in 0..99 (no Gen1 1/256 miss). brightPowder (the defender's HELD_BRIGHTPOWDER parameter, never met by alwaysHits): byte = floor(value*255/100) - param, at least 0; value = byte >= 255 ? value : ceil(byte*100/255). STATUS: freeze thaws when roll%5==0 (1/5); burn/poison residual max(1,floor(maxHp/8)); burn halves physical attack; toxic max(1,floor(maxHp*counter/16)); paralysis stops when roll%4==0 (1/4); sleep wakes and can move when the counter hits 0. BADGES (Crystal, as gen1recomp src/battle/gen2/Battle.lua ports it): badgeStats is Effects.badgeBoost(stat, key, badges, spa) -> value, badges a set of Gold ids. ZEPHYR->atk, MINERAL->def, PLAIN->spe, GLACIER->spa, each boostStat = min(999, v + floor(v/8)); Kanto ids boost no stat; spd only when GLACIER is held and glacierBoostsSpDef(boostStat(spa)): true at >= 999, else a = (floor(v/256) - 3 - (v%256 < 231 ? 1 : 0)) mod 256 and boosted when a is odd. badgeTypes is Effects.badgeTypeBoost(typeId, badges) -> boosted: the first of the 16 DoBadgeTypeBoosts rows naming typeId (registry id, PSYCHIC_TYPE for Psychic) answers whether its badge is held. Damage's badgeTypeBoost adds max(1, floor(d/8)) right after the 997+2 tail and before STAB. STAGES (pokecrystal CalcBattleStats): stages is Effects.applyStage(stat, stage) -> value = floor(stat*pct/100) for the stage percent (25,28,33,40,50,66,100,150,200,250,300,350,400), then 0 -> 1 and anything past 999 -> 999. BATTLESTATS (CalcPlayerStats): battleStats is Effects.battleStat({stats, stages, status}, key, badges) -> value: applyStage, then the badge boost (spd's Glacier tail reads boostStat of the STAGED spa), then burn halves atk / paralysis quarters spe, each at least 1. TRUNCATE (TruncateHL_BC): truncate is Damage.truncateStats(attack, defense, link) -> attack, defense: while either is over 255, defense = floor(defense/4) and attack = floor(attack/4), each 0 -> 1; link stops after one pass; both come out mod 256 (the wrap bug). STATUS confusion: a self-hit is Damage.compute at power 40 with no crit, STAB or matchup and roll 100 (no variation) on the attack/defense given, plus itemBoostPercent when given. ITEMS (src/BattleSim2/Items.lua, pokecrystal == pokegold for every rule): `kind` picks the rule. typeBoost: Items.typeBoostPercent(sheet, typeId) -> percent = (100 + holdParam) mod 256 - 100 when the HELD_<TYPE>_BOOST names typeId, else null; Damage's itemBoostPercent applies any non-zero percent as floor(d*(100+percent)/100). quickClaw: byte < param. brightPowder: as ACCURACY. speciesAttack (SpeciesItemBoost): LIGHT_BALL on PIKACHU doubles a special attack, THICK_CLUB on CUBONE/MAROWAK a physical one, mod 65536. metalPowder (DittoMetalPowder, folded pair): defender DITTO holding METAL_POWDER: s = def + floor(def/2); s < 256 -> def = s; else attack = max(1, floor(attack/2)), def = floor(s/2). focusBand (FalseSwipe): amount >= hp -> hp - 1 (at least 0), held true. sixteenth (GetSixteenthMaxHP): q = floor(maxHp/4) mod 256 (0 -> 1), then floor(q/4) (0 -> 1). berryWants: 2*hp < maxHp. obedienceCap: first of RISING 101, STORM 70, FOG 50, HIVE 30, else 10. swap: nibble swap. napTurns: swap((2*byte) mod 256) mod 8 (0 means redraw). kingsRockMove: the referee effect ids whose script runs `kingsrock` {0,3,7,16,17,26,27,29,39,40,41,43,44,45,48,77,81}, minus the effect-0 moves named in Items.KINGS_ROCK_FOLDED_EXCEPTIONS. critSpeciesItem: LUCKY_PUNCH on CHANSEY, STICK on FARFETCH_D (the battle species).",
